sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Inference Client
    participant Platform as Deploying Platform<br/>(KServe / ModelMesh)
    participant HTTP as HTTP Endpoint<br/>Port 8000
    participant gRPC as gRPC Endpoint<br/>Port 8033
    participant Adapter as vllm_tgis_adapter
    participant Engine as vLLM Engine<br/>PagedAttention
    participant GPU as AMD ROCm GPU
    participant Model as Model Weights<br/>(configured path)

    Note over Platform,Engine: Deployment Phase (one-time)
    Platform->>Engine: Deploy vllm-rocm container<br/>as non-root user 2000
    Engine->>Model: Load model weights<br/>from configured path
    Model-->>Engine: Model artifacts
    Engine->>GPU: Initialize ROCm<br/>GPU memory (PagedAttention)
    GPU-->>Engine: GPU ready

    Note over Client,GPU: HTTP Inference Flow (OpenAI-compatible)
    Client->>HTTP: POST /v1/completions<br/>or /v1/chat/completions
    HTTP->>Adapter: Route request
    Adapter->>Engine: Inference request
    Engine->>GPU: GPU computation<br/>(ROCm acceleration)
    GPU-->>Engine: Inference result
    Engine-->>Adapter: Generated tokens
    Adapter-->>HTTP: JSON response
    HTTP-->>Client: Completion response

    Note over Client,GPU: gRPC Inference Flow (TGIS-compatible)
    Client->>gRPC: GenerateStream RPC
    gRPC->>Adapter: Route request
    Adapter->>Engine: Inference request
    Engine->>GPU: GPU computation<br/>(ROCm acceleration)
    GPU-->>Engine: Token stream
    Engine-->>Adapter: Streaming tokens
    Adapter-->>gRPC: Stream response
    gRPC-->>Client: Streamed tokens

    Note over Engine: DISABLE_LOGPROBS_DURING_SPEC_DECODING=false<br/>Enables logprobs for hosted-model API compatibility
